asin is available in matte white, matte black and the colours of our Alice Palette.</div><div><b>Notes: </b>32mm non-overflow plug &amp; waste not included.</div><div><b>Recommended Plug &amp; Waste: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw006-mc\">SBW006/MC</a></b><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
